<title>USA: Amarillo feeder cattle prices steady-up $1 - USDA.</title>
<headline>Amarillo feeder cattle prices steady-up $1 - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>AMARILLO 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Feeder steers and heifers were steady to $1.00 per cwt higher, compared to last week, USDA said. Feeder steers and heifers under 600 lbs 47 percent, over 600 lbs 50 percent with cows and bulls around 3 percent of total supply. Trade was active and demand strong.</p>
<p>Feeder Steers - Medium and Large 1 - 600- 700 lbs 69.00-76.50, load and small lot 600-665 lbs 79.00-79.75; 700-800 lbs 68.00-71.50; 800-850 lbs 64.00-68.25. Medium and Large 1-2 - 600-700 lbs 63.00-70.00; 700-800 lbs 63.00-67.50; pkg 843 lbs 61.00. Small and Medium 1-2 - 600-700 lbs 67.00-73.00; part load 719 lbs 65.60.</p>
<p>Feeder Heifers - Medium and Large 1 - 600-700 lbs 65.00-70.40; 700-800 lbs 61.50-64.75; lot 804 lbs 61.25.</p>
<p>Medium and Large 1-2 - 600-700 lbs 62.00-64.50.</p>
<p>Receipts - 2,912  Week ago - 8,174  Year ago - 2,109</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
</text>
